        "code": "// Calls comboChart1's actions and reads its values by name, as RunJS code in a saved app does.\nawait components.comboChart1.clearClickedPoint();\nawait components.comboChart1.setLoading(true);\nawait components.comboChart1.setLoading(false);\nawait components.comboChart1.setDisable(true);\nawait components.comboChart1.setDisable(false);\nawait components.comboChart1.setVisibility(false);\nawait components.comboChart1.setVisibility(true);\nreturn { \"isVisible\": components.comboChart1.isVisible, \"isLoading\": components.comboChart1.isLoading, \"isDisabled\": components.comboChart1.isDisabled, \"clickedDataPoint\": components.comboChart1.clickedDataPoint };",
